{
  "policy_version": "0.1.0",
  "note": "Model IDs come from configuration/env, never hardcoded in code. `model_env` names the env var that supplies the concrete model id at runtime. `privacy` classifies data egress: 'local' never leaves the machine; 'cloud' may. The router refuses to send restricted/identity-scoped data to a 'cloud' profile.",
